---
layout: layout.njk
title: Assignment
description: Ready-made nursing assignment files.
category: Assignment
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">📝</div>
    <h1>Assignment</h1>

    <p class="cat-desc">
        Ready-made nursing college assignment files with proper formatting,
        headings, subheadings, and references. Covering all major nursing
        subjects for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing students.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.assignment | reverse %}
    <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>

            <p class="post-meta">
                {{ post.date | date("MMMM dd, yyyy") }}
                {% if post.data.subject %}
                | {{ post.data.subject }}
                {% endif %}
            </p>
        </div>

        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">View Assignment</a>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
